  <!-- Energy Cells

  Vanilla (Tier in parentheses, Tier functions as a scalar value used for determining a variety of things like drop rates as well as mod capacity and requirements, higher is rarer/better from 1 to 8):

    Mods:
    Radio Powered - Recharges (10 x Tier) per tick, up to (1 + Tier) max depth. Does not stack with Fidget/Solar, the higher recharge rate is used.
    High Capacity - Increases max charge to (Charge x (14 + Tier)) / 10.
    Gigantic - Doubles max charge, stacks with High Capacity (not sure yet if multiplicative or additive).

    Chem Cell (1) - 10000
    Fidget Cell (1) - 2500, recharges 2/20 per tick out of/in combat
    Solar Cell (2) - 2500, recharges 10 per tick in sunlight
    Nuclear Cell (7) - 100000
    Antimatter Cell (8) - 200000
    Liquid Fueled:
      Lead-Acid (4) - 4000 max, 500 per dram
      Combustion (4) - 6000 max, 750 per dram
      Thermoelectric (5) - 40000 max, 5000 per dram
      Biodynamic (6) - 60000, 7500 per dram

  Modded (Tier):

    Advanced Chem Cell (5) - 50000 (5x chem cell, half a nuclear cell)
    Dark Matter (8) - 500000
    Solar Cell Array (4) - 10000, recharges 25 per tick in sunlight (so 4x capacity and 2.5x recharge of basic solar cell)
    Solar Cell Nexus (7) - 50000, recharges 50 per tick in sunlight (so 20x capacity and 5x recharge of basic solar cell, or 5x capacity and 2x recharge of solar cell array)

  -->

